  <SpiderGoat.label>蜘蛛山羊</SpiderGoat.label>
  <!-- EN: A genetically engineered goat. Spliced with spider DNA, instead of milk they produce a silk-based synthread precursor. As a living synthread making machine they are very valuable.\n     \nHowever Spider goats are a very high maintenance domestic animal and cannot survive without human care. This is due to the goat being genetically optimized to produce silk, at the detriment of other biological functions. -->
  <SpiderGoat.description>一种经过基因工程改造的山羊。它们与蜘蛛DNA进行了基因拼接，因此无法产奶，而是能产生一种以丝绸为基础的合成丝前体。作为活体合成丝制造机，它们非常珍贵。
     
然而，蜘蛛山羊是一种养护成本极高的家畜，若无人照料便无法存活。这是因为该山羊经过基因优化以生产丝绸，却因此牺牲了其他生理功能。</SpiderGoat.description>
